   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>Negotiated Price</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Non-residential area of 558.30 sq.m. in a newly built building located at 42, Kovkeb Safaraliyeva Street, Nasimi district, Baku is for sale in cash or on credit."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "It is located near the Tea Factory, located near the May 28 metro station. It is provided with gas, water, electricity and 24-hour security service."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "The facility is suitable for a bank, clinic, supermarket, shopping center, restaurant."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<em><strong>Note: Those who buy these non-residential facilities are given a loan of 50,000 AZN from our bank at an annual rate of 15% for repairs.</strong></em>"
  },
